"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThe wait at the place we originally planned to go was too long, so we found a nearby cafe with a friendly name and walked in.  \n\nWe ordered brunch and coffee to have a light meal.  \nIt was quite busy and more popular than expected — if we had hesitated a bit longer, there would have been no seats.  \n\nThere were plenty of locals enjoying a casual brunch.  \nThe coffee was good, and overall it was a decent spot.  \n\nIt reminded me once again that even unplanned, impromptu stops can turn into good experiences.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"